, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Dragonstorm (phenomenon)\", section \"Stormnexus Ritual\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."},{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Narset","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Narset","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Narset#:~:text=the%20spell%20had%20also%20reactivated%20the%20dragonstorms","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Narset\", section \"The Stormnexus Ritual\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}]},{"text":"Narset warned that they had grown worse, reshaping the land and producing larger and hungrier dragons.","cites":["tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-1-stories-and-their-bones-e11","tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-2-omens-e3"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-1-stories-and-their-bones#:~:text=They%27ve%20become%20strong%20enough,reshape%20the%20very%20land.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-2-omens#:~:text=So%20much%20so%2C%20they%27ve,to%20reshape%20Tarkir%20itself%2C"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Episode 1: Stories and Their Bones ","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-1-stories-and-their-bones","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-1-stories-and-their-bones#:~:text=They%27ve%20become%20strong%20enough,reshape%20the%20very%20land.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Episode 1: Stories and Their Bones \" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Episode 2: Omens","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2025-03-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-2-omens","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-2-omens#:~:text=So%20much%20so%2C%20they%27ve,to%20reshape%20Tarkir%20itself%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Episode 2: Omens\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Mar 2025."}]},{"text":"Dragons and dragonstorms began appearing on other planes through the Omenpaths.","cites":["dragonstorm-phenomenon-e6","tarkir-dragonstorm-e2"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Dragonstorm_%28phenomenon%29#:~:text=Tarkiri%20dragons%20began%20appearing%20on%20other%20planes.","https://mtg.wiki/page/Tarkir%3A_Dragonstorm#:~:text=render%20large%20areas%20uninhabitable,spawn%20new%2C%20uncontrolled%20dragons"],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Dragonstorm (phenomenon)","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dragonstorm_%28phenomenon%29","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Dragonstorm_%28phenomenon%29#:~:text=Tarkiri%20dragons%20began%20appearing%20on%20other%20planes.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Dragonstorm (phenomenon)\", section \"On other planes\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."},{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Tarkir%3A_Dragonstorm","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Tarkir%3A_Dragonstorm#:~:text=render%20large%20areas%20uninhabitable,spawn%20new%2C%20uncontrolled%20dragons","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm\", section \"Storyline\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}]},{"text":"Ugin later returned to quell them.